WEBVTT

00:33:26.623 --> 00:33:30.391
courtesy of the Internet and this technology,

00:33:30.391 --> 00:33:32.041
you're here, back in North America,

00:33:32.041 --> 00:33:36.057
not quite the U.S., Canada, in this form.

00:33:36.057 --> 00:33:40.951
I'm curious, how does that feel?

00:33:40.951 --> 00:33:43.089
ES: Canada is different than what I expected.

00:33:43.089 --> 00:33:45.214
It's a lot warmer.

00:33:45.214 --> 00:33:50.921
(Laughter)

00:33:50.921 --> 00:33:54.177
CA: At TED, the mission is "ideas worth spreading."

00:33:54.177 --> 00:33:56.375
If you could encapsulate it in a single idea,

00:33:56.375 --> 00:33:58.590
what is your idea worth spreading

00:33:58.590 --> 00:34:02.665
right now at this moment?